	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Starting today, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"I",
{"/font"},
" shall be the one to take care of Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Hotori-chan, we appreciate the effort you've put into preparing this meal, but I'm afraid we cannot accept it.”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Kanami gently but firmly slides back the homemade lunch that Hotori placed in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I've been taking care of Soujin since forever now. I won't back down that easily.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"She slides the lunchbox back into its original spot.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I am Onii-sama's family.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm his oldest friend.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't fight, you t─”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami & Hotori"},
			{
"“We are not.” “We're not.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“R-Right.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Half a year has passed since Kanami and I deepened our relationship with each other.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
{"font", size=53},
"With each passing day under Empress Hisui's reign, the Empire moves closer and closer towards peace, but it seems that war is about to break out around me at any moment.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I have been by Onii-sama's side ever since he became a member of House Tokita.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“It is only natural that I ought to be the one taking care of him.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It's not the length of time that matters, but the quality.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Why, when his amnesia left him feeling all alone and anxious, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"I",
{"/font"},
" was the one who was there by his side aaaall night long.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“A-All night long...?”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What a poor little thing he was, not having any of his memories...”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Even though he's normally so brave, there were times he\ncouldn't help but show his vulnerable side.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Right, I remember now.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Feeling completely lost in the world at being unable to remember even my own name, I once had Hotori stay up all night to tell me stories from our past.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"I'm incredibly grateful even now that she was willing to keep me company back then.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But that night, Soujin was different even from his usual self.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“He suddenly reached out to me... and before I knew it,\nhe'd buried his head in my chest...”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Even though I was so embarrassed, I could only─”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Stop making things up.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh? Am I?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"What in the world does her recollection of that night look like?",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Heh, hehehee...”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Is that really the best you've got for your 'quality time,' Hotori-chan?”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
{"font", size=45},
"“Every single one of my 'Unforgettable Moments with\nOnii-Sama'─ninety-nine of them and counting, for your information─makes your little night look like nothing by comparison.”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Wh-What the heck is that!?”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I thought you'd never ask!”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Unforgettable Moments With Onii-sama, Number Forty-Six: ～A Sultry Night's Rendezvous～”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“On a certain midsummer evening, I was caught up in a discussion with my tea ceremony instructor, so I was late in returning to the manor.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“There were terrible rumors of a street slasher at large, so I traversed the familiar way home at a light jog.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“The night was an unusually humid one; the sort that makes your breath catch in your throat, and soon, my undershirt was soaked with sweat.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“'Oh, how scary. How unpleasant. Oh, how I yearn to get home right away and leap into Onii-sama's waiting\nbosom.'”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“'...But would he find it bothersome if I clung to him, covered in sweat as I am?'”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“My head filled with such thoughts as these, I hurried down the long road home.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry for interrupting... but is this gonna be a long story?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“But then, all of a sudden! On the other side of the road, the dark figure of a well-built stranger came dimly into view!”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"It's no use. Kanami didn't hear a single thing I said.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Overcome with terror, my legs lost all strength and I fell helplessly to the ground...”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“'Ah, he's getting closer and closer! His rugged hands are reaching straight for me!'”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“But in the next moment, that gentleman raised his voice.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"'Sorry I'm late, Kanami.'",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Ohhh! How to describe the emotions I felt in that beautiful moment?!”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“At once, it was as though I was suddenly set with\nOnii-sama's child!”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Are you whacked in the head?”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"She regales us with several other such stories for another ten minutes.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“What say you to ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"this",
{"/font"},
" level of quality?! I daresay it's tip-top indeed!”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So basically, you were running late, Soujin came to pick you up, and you walked home together?”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Could you please refrain from such crude summaries?”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“To do so would be to neglect the depth of Onii-sama's ardent yet anguished love that transcends the boundaries of mere family!”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Kanami seems to imagine me as a dangerous man tormented by irrepressible lust for his own sister.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I hope that makes it perfectly clear. ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"I",
{"/font"},
" shall be the one to take care of Onii-sama from now on.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That makes literally no sense...”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“In fact, I'm scared to leave the two of you alone together in the same room now.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Hotori-chan, stop being such a sore loser!”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What was that?!”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"The room descends into a flurry of high-pitched screeching.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(This is bad. Man, is this bad...)”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"I busy myself with the miso tofu from Hotori's lunchbox as I pray for Oomikami to have mercy on me.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"Oh, this is good stuff...",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"The rich body and smooth mouthfeel, coupled with the subtle umami of the finish makes it a dead ringer for Tanshu-grown soybeans, perhaps even a first harvest.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"If you know, you know.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami & Hotori"},
			{
"“Onii-sama!” “Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm tofuing. Can you please leave me alone?”",
			},
