			{
"Kanami wordlessly places the lid back on the lunchbox.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I believe it would be best to allow Onii-sama to decide.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I have no objections to that.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"The two fix me with deadly serious eyes.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ah... ahem!”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In the first place, I'd say I'm well past the age of needing to be taken care of.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Me or Hotori-chan. Who shall it be?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, really, I can take care of my─”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Me... or her?”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kh...”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"It seems like I won't be afforded the luxury of a third option.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"This is bad... No matter who I choose, things are going to get ugly.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I've heard more than enough!”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"The door slides open, and the manager bursts in out of nowhere.",
