			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I don't mean to be rude, but you'd best get it into your heads: Your little kiddy napes just won't cut it for him! Do I make myself clear?!”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh? Hmm? Hmmmmm?”",
